<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ 105-day seasonal bills yield 9.812 pct.</title>
<headline>NZ 105-day seasonal bills yield 9.812 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average yield on NZ$75 million of 105-day seasonal Treasury bills at Tuesday's tender was 9.812 percent, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>Bids totalled NZ$158 million.</p>
</text>
